# `pipelines.update_status`

Advance a pipeline run's lifecycle/gate state (the agent's own run).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.runtime.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `pipeline_run_id` | `string` |
| `status` | `string` |
| `worktree` | `string` |
| `pid` | `number` |
| `gate_agent` | `string` |
| `blocker` | `string` |
| `error` | `string` |

## Returns

`JsonResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `json` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipelines.update_status --json '{ "pipeline_run_id": "", "status": "", "worktree": "", "pid": 0, "gate_agent": "", "blocker": "", "error": "" }'
